Apple today <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/18/homeview-27-2-1-software/">released a new software update</a> for the HomeView, and it fixes two <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri/">Siri</a> issues <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/16/apple-homeview-smart-home-hub-has-some-issues/">users were running into</a>.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/10/Apple-HomeView-lineup-feature0.jpg" alt="" width="2500" height="1406" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1070613" /><br/>
According to Apple, HomeView 27.2.1 fixes a bug that could cause &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; requests to fail if the HomeView is paired to an iPhone or <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad/">iPad</a> running the iOS 27.3 or iPadOS 27.3 betas.<br/>
<br/>
It also addresses an issue that caused the HomeView to fail to download support for &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; when setting up a Shared Album on the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/photos/">Photos</a> face.<br/>
<br/>
A third fix prevents the HomeView from being removed from the home when connecting another home hub. From Apple's release notes:<br/>
<blockquote>This update provides important bug fixes for your HomeView, including fixes for the following issues:<br/>
- Setting up a Shared Album on the Photos face may prevent the device from downloading support for Siri, causing Siri to be unavailable<br/>
- Pairing with an iPhone or iPad running the iOS or iPadOS 27.3 beta may cause Siri requests to fail<br/>
- Connecting another home hub device may unexpectedly remove HomeView from your home</blockquote><br/>
Shortly after the HomeView launched, complaints started rolling in. Users found the device would not set alarms or timers, and some users had problems downloading &zwnj;Siri&zwnj;. Music commands failed in some cases, and there were also delays in &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; responses. Apple's notes don't mention alarms, timers, or music, but the &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; fixes may address some of the issues.<br/>
<br/>
Reviewer Joanna Stern also ran into a bug that prevented &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; AI from unlocking door locks and garage doors by voice after authenticating with the camera. Apple said it will <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/12/apple-plans-homeview-update-with-siri-fix/">fix the bug in December</a>.<br/>
<br/>
